    "body": "## Summary\n- add an admin-only `/admin/job-reports` moderation page backed by the audited report endpoints\n- support pending-first queue browsing, status filtering, pagination and report detail inspection\n- let admins record one terminal `REVIEWED` or `DISMISSED` decision with an optional internal note\n- surface the pending report count and navigation entry on the main admin dashboard\n- document the web moderation flow\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- the UI consumes only the moderation-safe response and does not expose exact job locations, route geometry or live tracking\n- the route stays behind the existing `RequireAdmin` / `ROLE_ADMIN` boundaries\n- moderation still does not automatically delete listings, suspend users or mutate escrow\n\n## Validation\nRun frontend lint/build, Maven verify, Flyway/PostgreSQL/runtime smoke and existing payment/runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
